diagnostic_evidence.quote:
Applying the FFT to $\{\ai_{\bm{l}}\}_{\bm{l}\in\mathcal{I}_{\bm{m}}}$ yields
\begin{align}
    \hat{\ai}_{\bm{k}}
    =
    \sum_{\bm{l}\in\mathcal{I}_{\bm{m}}}
        \ai_{\bm{l}}\,
        e^{\frac{2\pi}{L}\i\,\bm{k}\cdot(h\bm{l})},
    \qquad
    \bm{k}\in\mathcal{I}_{\bm{m}},
\end{align}
which approximates $\hat{\rho}(\bm{k})\,\hat\varphi(\bm{k})$.

\STATE[$\bm{\aii}=\mathbf{F}^{-1}\hat{\bm{\aii}}$] Inverse FFT:
\begin{align*}
    \aii_{\bm l}
    =
    \sum_{\bm k\in\mathcal I_{\bm m}}
    \hat \aii_{\bm k}\,e^{-\frac{2\pi}{L}\i\,\bm k\cdot(h\bm l)},
    \qquad \bm l\in \mathcal{I}_{\bm{m}}.
\end{align*}

