failure_location.quote:
\begin{lemma}[Lattice covering lemma in $\R^3$]
\label{lem:cubecover}
Let $f:[0,\infty)\to[0,\infty)$ be nonincreasing. For $K>\sqrt{3}/2$,
\begin{align}
\sum_{|\bm{k}|>K} f(|\bm{k}|)
\;\le\;
\int_{|\bx|>K-\sqrt{3}/2}
f(|\bx|)\,d\bx.
\end{align}
\end{lemma}
